---
// Value vs Pointer Receiver decision tree + nil vs empty slice JSON comparison.
const W = 900;
const H = 290;
---
<figure class="gmrec">
  <div class="gmrec-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparison of nil slice versus empty slice JSON serialization and pointer versus value receiver selection rules.">
      {/* Left panel: nil vs empty slice */}
      <rect x="14" y="16" width="426" height="256" rx="10" class="gmrec-card" />
      <text x="30" y="44" class="gmrec-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. nil vs. empty slice: len == 0 for both</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. nil vs. empty slice: cả hai đều có len == 0</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="64" width="394" height="84" rx="6" class="gmrec-sub" />
      <text x="44" y="88" class="gmrec-b">var s []string</text>
      <text x="44" y="109" class="gmrec-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>0 heap allocs · s == nil is true · len(s) == 0</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>0 cấp phát heap · s == nil là true · len(s) == 0</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="131" class="gmrec-warn">json.Marshal(s) → "null"</text>

      <rect x="30" y="164" width="394" height="84" rx="6" class="gmrec-sub" />
      <text x="44" y="188" class="gmrec-b">s := []string{'{'}{'}'}  /  make([]string, 0)</text>
      <text x="44" y="209" class="gmrec-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>points to zerobase · s == nil is false · len(s) == 0</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>trỏ tới zerobase · s == nil là false · len(s) == 0</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="231" class="gmrec-ok">json.Marshal(s) → "[]"</text>

      {/* Right panel: Receiver rule */}
      <rect x="460" y="16" width="426" height="256" rx="10" class="gmrec-card" />
      <text x="476" y="44" class="gmrec-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Value vs. pointer receiver rule of thumb</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Quy tắc chọn Value vs. Pointer receiver</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="476" y="64" width="394" height="104" rx="6" class="gmrec-sub is-red" />
      <text x="490" y="88" class="gmrec-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Must use Pointer (*T) when:</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bắt buộc dùng Pointer (*T) khi:</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="490" y="110" class="gmrec-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Method mutates the receiver state</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Method cần thay đổi dữ liệu của struct</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="490" y="130" class="gmrec-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Struct embeds non-copyable field (sync.Mutex)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Struct chứa trường cấm copy (như sync.Mutex)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="490" y="150" class="gmrec-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Struct is large or another method already uses *T</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Struct lớn hoặc đã có method khác dùng *T</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="476" y="182" width="394" height="66" rx="6" class="gmrec-sub is-ok" />
      <text x="490" y="206" class="gmrec-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Use Value (T) when:</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Dùng Value (T) khi:</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="490" y="228" class="gmrec-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Small, immutable values (time.Time, map, func, chan)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Kiểu nhỏ, bất biến hoặc header (time.Time, map, chan)</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Left: always check len(s) == 0 instead of s == nil, yet distinguish nil from []T{'{'}{'}'} at JSON API edges. Right: when in doubt between value and pointer receivers, consistency across all methods of a type wins.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Trái: luôn kiểm tra độ rỗng bằng len(s) == 0 thay vì s == nil, nhưng cần phân biệt nil và []T{'{'}{'}'} khi xuất JSON. Phải: nếu phân vân giữa value và pointer receiver, hãy ưu tiên sự nhất quán trên toàn bộ method của kiểu đó.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gmrec { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gmrec-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gmrec svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gmrec text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gmrec-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gmrec-sub { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gmrec-sub.is-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .gmrec-sub.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gmrec-sub.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gmrec-h { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gmrec-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gmrec-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gmrec-warn { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .gmrec-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gmrec-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gmrec-m { font-size: 11px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gmrec figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
